<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/lakzmI/dict/kna/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "लक्ष्मी\t/lakṣmī/\t/lakSmI/\t/лакшми/\tlakṣmī f. прелесть, красота, счастье; nom. pr. богини красоты и счастья.\tс. 260"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "kna" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/lakzmI/dict/fri/3> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
